criteria:
Inclusion criteria:
Age 18 years or older and capacity to provide informed consent;

sufficient understanding of the provided participant information and consent documents and ability to communicate reliably during the interview;

self-identification as a member of the Bear community or use of a Bear-related self-identification;

personal production and publication of sexual or erotic content on OnlyFans at the time of recruitment or within the previous 12 months;

technical and communicative ability to participate in an online interview;

written informed consent to study participation, audio recording, transcription, and scientific analysis of the interview.
Exclusion criteria:
Age below 18 years;

lack of capacity to provide informed consent;

no Bear-related self-identification;

exclusive use of OnlyFans as a subscriber or consumer without producing own content;

no personal publication of sexual or erotic content on OnlyFans at the time of recruitment or within the previous 12 months;

absence or withdrawal of valid informed consent;

insufficient understanding of the study information or inability to communicate reliably during the interview;

technical or communication-related circumstances that prevent the online interview from being conducted in an understandable and data-protection-compliant manner.
